<title>USA: Alexander Haagen names new CFO.</title>
<headline>Alexander Haagen names new CFO.</headline>
<dateline>MANHATTAN BEACH, Calif. 1997-02-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Alexander Haagen Properties Inc said Friday that Seymour Kreshek retired as an officer and director of the company.</p>
<p>Concurrently, the company announced the appointment of Stuart Gulland as senior vice president, chief financial officer and treasurer. Gulland has been vice president of finance of the company since April 1995.</p>
